            "review_title": "Review at Tascus Food & Drinks Dinh Liet",
            "review_text": "Tuệ N\n2 contributions\n0\nThe staff at “Tascus” are always enthusiastic and friendly. Even when the restaurant is crowded during peak hours\nApr 2025 • Business\nI have to travel far from home for work, which makes me feel really homesick. Every time I dine at Tascus, I experience a taste of home that’s both familiar and refreshingly unique—a delightful blend of Vietnamese style with a hint of my own hometown’s flavor.\n\nTascus isn’t just a stop for quick bites; it’s a place that preserves the warmth and nostalgic essence of a cozy home kitchen. If you’re looking for a fast, yet soul-satisfying dining experience, Tascus is sure to exceed your expectations.\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2025",
