            "review_title": "Review at Tascus Food & Drinks Dinh Liet",
            "review_text": "Luis A\n3 contributions\n1\nHole-in-a-Wall Banh Mi\nMar 2025 • Friends\nThe spot is unique. You can easily spot it while walking along the street of Dinh Liet. The staff were warm & accommodating. They even gave us a free gifts.\n\nAs for the food, it’s a mix of american & Vietnamese flavors. It was nice & flavorful.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 14, 2025\nTascus Food\nHey Luisa, you totally made our day with this review! We're so stoked you loved our unique spot and our friendly staff. Mixing American and Vietnamese flavors is our jam, and we're glad you enjoyed it! See you next time for more tasty treats and good vibes! Love you so much 🥰\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
